the realm  do you know what the realm is  it's the thousand blades of aegon's  enemies  a story we agreed to tell each other  over  and over till we forget that it's a lie  what's up ladies and gentlemen welcome  back for another game of thrones and  house of the dragon update video in this  video i will be discussing the recent  official announcement regarding this  year's comic con that's being held in  san diego now for those of you who don't  know hbo will be having their very own  conference for house of the dragon at  san diego's comic con in only a few  weeks from now now that we're only a  little over a month away from the  release of house of the dragon's first  season hbo as well as house of the  dragon's creators will begin to hype up  their show even more than before not  only will house of the dragon  showrunners be there but so will most of  the main actors as well i'm guessing  they will discuss what it was like  making the show as well as what we might  expect to see in the very first season  there's also a very good chance that  this is when they will release their  first official full trailer  for those of you who are wondering san  diego's comic-con is being held from  thursday july the 21st to that sunday  july 24th which is only one month before  the release of house of the dragon i'm  thinking we will get the first full  trailer somewhere around one of those  dates now the good thing is this isn't  even the best news if you ask me what i  find to be very interesting about this  announcement is the fact that george rr  martin will be there as well this will  be the first comic con he has attended  since game of thrones season 4 which was  also the last time he has ever wrote an  episode now if you've seen some of my  older videos then you would know that i  think that was right around when i  believe george rr martin had a falling  out with game of thrones writers david  and dan  as i'm sure most of you already know  after game of thrones season 4 is when  david and dan really started to deviate  from george rr martin's a song of ice  and fire novels this is a big reason why  george stopped writing for the show now  he always said it was so he could focus  on writing the wins of winter but we all  know he wasn't doing that either i think  he left because he could no longer  recognize game of thrones as a  representation or adaptation of his own  work  not only did he stop writing for the  show but he also stopped showing up at  events for the show as well  he hasn't been seen at one of these  conventions ever since  well that's until now  according to these announcements he will  be there with the other creators and  actors from house of the dragon if you  look at house of the dragon's official  social media they've revealed who will  all be there during this year's massive  convention it will be george rr martin  ryan condell and miguel sapochnick who  as you all know are the creators writers  and showrunners for house of the dragon  the actors who will be there are matt  smith patty considine olivia cook emma  darcy steve toussaint eve best and  several others  basically all of house of the dragon's  heaviest hitters will be there  discussing the show now i don't know  about you but i think this would be the  best time to drop that first full  trailer after all this would not be the  first time hbo dropped the new trailer  for game of thrones at san diego's comic  con they did that for game of thrones  season 7 as well  so i do think we very well could get one  during that weekend  now let's get back to george rr martin i  think the fact that he is actually  attending this comic con is a good sign  for us fans of the show i believe it  further shows his confidence in the new  series  it's basically another cosign from the  writer and creator himself  like he said in his not a blog updates  he's already seen nine of the episodes  from the first season and he loves them  he's also went on and on about how great  all of the writers are as well something  he never did for dan and dave in fact  after game of thrones season 4 he  wouldn't even mention their names let  alone be seen sitting next to them  now maybe i'm over excited about all of  this but i really am happy george rr  martin is this heavily involved with the  show i think he made a great decision  getting ryan kondo hired on as a  showrunner because based on everything  i've seen and read ryan is making sure  george knows exactly what's happening  with the show every step of the way now  i'm anxious to see what will be revealed  about the news show during the  convention i will make sure to let you  know if any new interesting information  is revealed remember it is being held  during the weekend of july 21st so make  sure you keep your eyes open for any new  updates i can guarantee there will be  also make sure to look for any of my  other new videos over the next few days  i have a few more updates that i will be  discussing in the following videos  as always i want to thank everyone for  watching this video i hope all of you  have a great day and weekend  i will be seeing you again very soon  bye  [Music]  [Music]  you

